{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119027","id":3593427973,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7WL1wF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119027","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119027.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119027.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119027","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119027/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119027/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119027/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3b87df42197a185263e826450e192338c73a30e5","number":119027,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Web] Fix Bus.addAt(-1) scrambling bus array on Sample playback","user":{"login":"bziebart123","id":198497440,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9TUoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198497440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123","html_url":"https://github.com/bziebart123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bziebart123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #119026.\r\n\r\nWhen `AudioServer::add_bus(p_at_pos)` is called with `p_at_pos >= buses.size()`, the value is normalized to `-1` (\"append\") and forwarded to JS via `add_sample_bus(p_at_pos)`. JS `Bus.addAt(-1)` correctly creates the bus at the end via `Bus.create()`, but then enters the `if (index !== newBus.getId())` branch (since `-1 !== N`) and calls `Bus.move(newBus.getId(), -1)`. `Bus.move`'s body does `splice(toIndex - 1, 0, item)` -> `splice(-2, 0, item)`, inserting at `length - 2` instead of at end. The JS bus array desyncs from C++; subsequent `set_bus_send(busIdx, sendIdx)` calls land on the wrong buses; Master's `_send` ends up reassigned away from `null`; `Bus.connect()`'s unconditional `getOutputNode().disconnect()` severs Master from `ctx.destination`.\r\n\r\nResult: every web export with `default_playback_type.web=Sample` (the default since 4.3 via #91382) and >=2 buses is silent on Sample playback. `register_sample` produces real PCM (verified by reading the `AudioBuffer` post-`copyToChannel` — amplitude ~1.0), the `SampleNode` lifecycle runs cleanly to `_source.start()`, but the bus chain leading to `ctx.destination` is broken.\r\n\r\n**Fix:** skip `Bus.move` when `index === -1`. The bus is already at the correct position from `Bus.create`'s push.\r\n\r\n**Testing:** I verified by patching the bundled `library_godot_audio.js` post-export on a Godot 4.6.2 single-threaded HTML5 build with 5 buses (Master + Music + Ambient + SFX + Vocab). Pre-fix: Master `_send=3`, audio silent at master peak `-inf`. Post-fix: Master `_send=null` (direct to destination), audio plays correctly. No regression on single-bus or stream-mode scenarios.\r\n\r\nSingle-file, single-line behavioral change (plus a comment block explaining why the guard exists, so the next contributor doesn't remove it).\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu